125
00:04:09.572 --> 00:04:11.620
Thank you. (chuckles)

126
00:04:11.620 --> 00:04:13.550
That contributes a lot of things about why-

127
00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:14.537
Mitosis is, there you go.

128
00:04:14.537 --> 00:04:16.693
